  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-03T13:05:51.752Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen opening a slider in the Action Menu the background of the rest of the Action Menu gets transparent to direct the focus of the user to the slider.\n\nThis is also the case with the Action Menu Opacity slider, here it makes it really hard to set the opacity to a value you want, since when ever you open the slider the opacity changes for what it normally is.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nWhen opening the Opacity Slider for the Action Menu the opacity of the Action Menu it self should not change. (Please still keep this functionality for the rest of the Slider though as there it makes a lot of sense)\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/lp4b0g.mp4",
